# Repos where devbrain must never write database migrations, even though it may
# touch app code/docs there. A merged migration against a production database is a
# different class of risk than merged app code — list any repo here where you want
# that extra safeguard. Empty by default: no repo is blocked unless you opt it in.
#
# One repo name per line, same convention as devbrain-projects.allow.
#
# Example (remove the leading '#' to enable):
# example-repo
